  {
   "@id": "http://localhost:8080/cheapest-long-distance-moving/#faq",
   "@type": "FAQPage",
   "mainEntity": [
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "No single company is cheapest on every route. Prices shift with your load's weight, the distance, the date and how full a mover's trucks are, so the cheapest long distance moving company for one household can be the dearest for the next. Compare written estimates for the same inventory and dates."
     },
     "name": "Who is the cheapest long-distance mover?"
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Give every mover the same inventory, dates and services, and ask for a written estimate after an in-home or video survey. Check whether each is binding, what valuation it includes and how long the delivery window is. A quote far below the rest is a reason to ask questions, not to sign."
     },
     "name": "How do you compare the cheapest long distance moving quotes?"
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "They cost most of any way to move: $5,700–$11,800 for a home of 4 or more bedrooms over 1,000 road miles, off peak. They are worth it when a self-move would mean weeks of packing, a large truck you'd rather not drive, or heavy pieces you can't lift. Packing yourself is the usual way to bring the bill down."
     },
     "name": "Are full-service long-distance movers worth the price?"
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "No. A calculator, like the one on this page, gives a range for homes like yours, based on size, distance and date. A mover's written estimate, made after it has seen your belongings, is the price you can hold it to. Use the range to spot a cheapest long distance moving quote that looks too good to be true."
     },
     "name": "Is a long-distance moving calculator as good as a quote?"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}